# (the user's, 2026-11-23) The sets the FM-1 comes with: at the first start of 1.5.0, Winter Set and 4 to 5 a.m.
# (sets/: the Sets page's files, in the image) stored into the first empty set slots, in order, the same bytes the Sets
# page sends (their cues kept, not played); WORK saved with D1C_F_SETS, so never again on that unit: a set deleted
# stays deleted, a second start adds nothing. A unit with sets 1-3 used (a 1.5.0 beta's: no flag) gets them in 4 and 5;
# a full store (8 used) none, and goes on; the flash failing in the boot leaves the unit working, the next boot storing
# the rest (not a set twice); a return to 1.4.x and back keeps the flag. The header says how many were added, once.
# a fresh unit: the boot stored them in sets 1 and 2, and WORK with the flag (3 saves: two sets, WORK)
wait 300
expect setmask 3
expect firstsets 1
expect works 1
expect store_writes 3
msgis 2 SETS ADDED
sethas 0 Winter Set
sethas 1 4 to 5 a.m.
setbytes 0 sets/winter-set.dub1
setbytes 1 sets/four-to-five.dub1
shot fresh.png
# they load as any stored set: Winter Set's five pieces, 4 to 5 a.m.'s four
tap PLAY
wait 400
expect playing 0
sxreq 30 0200 30
tap GLO
wait 100
setstate yes
expect setlen 5
expectname 0 Hoarfrost
expectname 4 Thaw
expect slotcues0 >0
expect cuesoff 0
sxreq 30 0201 30
tap GLO
wait 100
setstate yes
expect setlen 4
expectname 0 Night Drive
expectname 3 Haze
wait 3500
# a second start adds nothing, says nothing
reboot
wait 300
expect setmask 3
expect firstsets 1
expect store_writes 5
msgis -
# set 1 deleted (DELETE, GLO yes): it doesn't come back
tap PLAY
wait 400
expect playing 0
sxreq 31 0200 31
tap GLO
wait 100
setstate yes
wait 3500
expect setmask 2
reboot
wait 300
expect setmask 2
sethas 0 -
sethas 1 4 to 5 a.m.
expect firstsets 1
msgis -
# a 1.5.0 beta's unit, sets 1 to 3 used (sent from the computer), WORK without the flag: they go in 4 and 5
tap PLAY
wait 400
expect playing 0
setsdelete
expect setmask 0
name -1 Mine A
dub1set build/scenarios/firstsets/a.dub1 3
name -1 Mine B
dub1set build/scenarios/firstsets/b.dub1 2
name -1 Mine C
dub1set build/scenarios/firstsets/c.dub1 1
name -1 -
setsend 0 build/scenarios/firstsets/a.dub1
wait 100
tap GLO
wait 100
setstate yes
wait 3500
setsend 1 build/scenarios/firstsets/b.dub1
wait 100
tap GLO
wait 100
setstate yes
wait 3500
setsend 2 build/scenarios/firstsets/c.dub1
wait 100
tap GLO
wait 100
setstate yes
wait 3500
setsbeta
expect firstsets 0
reboot
wait 300
expect setmask 31
expect firstsets 1
msgis 2 SETS ADDED
sethas 0 Mine A
sethas 1 Mine B
sethas 2 Mine C
sethas 3 Winter Set
sethas 4 4 to 5 a.m.
setbytes 3 sets/winter-set.dub1
setbytes 4 sets/four-to-five.dub1
# one stored already (Winter Set in set 6, the computer's), set 4 free: only 4 to 5 a.m. added, into set 4
tap PLAY
wait 400
expect playing 0
setsdelete 3
setsdelete 4
setsend 5 sets/winter-set.dub1
wait 100
tap GLO
wait 100
setstate yes
wait 3500
setsbeta
reboot
wait 300
expect setmask 47
msgis 1 SET ADDED
sethas 3 4 to 5 a.m.
sethas 5 Winter Set
setbytes 3 sets/four-to-five.dub1
# a full store (eight used, no flag): none added, nothing overwritten, the flag saved, the unit plays on
tap PLAY
wait 400
expect playing 0
setsend 4 build/scenarios/firstsets/a.dub1
wait 100
tap GLO
wait 100
setstate yes
wait 3500
setsend 6 build/scenarios/firstsets/b.dub1
wait 100
tap GLO
wait 100
setstate yes
wait 3500
setsend 7 build/scenarios/firstsets/c.dub1
wait 100
tap GLO
wait 100
setstate yes
wait 3500
expect setmask 255
setsbeta
reboot
wait 300
expect setmask 255
expect firstsets 1
msgis -
sethas 0 Mine A
sethas 3 4 to 5 a.m.
sethas 4 Mine A
sethas 5 Winter Set
sethas 6 Mine B
sethas 7 Mine C
expect playing 1
wait 2000
expect playing 1
# the flash failing in the first start's (its 20th erase or program: in the second set): the first kept, no flag, the
# unit plays; the next start stores the second (the first not twice)
tap PLAY
wait 400
expect playing 0
setsdelete
setsbeta
bootcut 20
reboot
wait 300
expect setmask 1
expect firstsets 0
sethas 0 Winter Set
msgis -
expect playing 1
wait 2000
expect playing 1
reboot
wait 300
expect setmask 3
expect firstsets 1
msgis 1 SET ADDED
sethas 0 Winter Set
sethas 1 4 to 5 a.m.
setbytes 0 sets/winter-set.dub1
setbytes 1 sets/four-to-five.dub1
# a return to 1.4.x and back (its save newer than WORK: migrated again): the flag kept, set 2 deleted stays deleted
tap PLAY
wait 400
expect playing 0
setsdelete 1
store36
reboot
wait 300
expect migrated >0
expect setmask 1
expect firstsets 1
msgis -
